   Workers Planned: 2
   ->  Parallel Custom Scan (LionAntiJoin)
         Lion Indexes: lion_swf_fk (fk = o.k), lion_swf_x (x = 1), lion_swf_kind (kind = 'c'::text)
         Join Key Lookups: in index order
         Join Rows: the outer rows without a match
